      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALL IN THE MIND (1) got all the way to some Saturday class middle-distance and staying races last year. He must have had issues that kept him away so long but the betting will be the biggest guide, especially over this sprint trip. HOW'S IT KEV (3) has trialled nicely since his last effort back in May. He does have a lovely record here. Just needs to keep in touch early. CROOK (6) has found one better at her last three races. She wasn't beaten far in them though. Will be getting a nice run here. VIERVILLE (9) has a strong first-up record so may run you a race. Is in the right stable to do that. FETES DES MERES (7) went so much better a month back but is dropping back 300m into this race so it's tougher.",
